<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>golfdad.cc</title>
  <meta name="description" content="golfdad.cc on the Mobley network">
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: dark; }
    html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; background: #050505; color: #f2efe7; font-family: -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif; }
    body { display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; padding: 24px; }
    .card { width: min(960px, 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 191, 0, 0.24); background: rgba(0,0,0,.78); box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,191,0,.08), 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.45); padding: 48px; }
    h1 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px); letter-spacing: 0; }
    p { margin: 0 0 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(242,239,231,.82); max-width: 70ch; }
    .muted { color: rgba(242,239,231,.56); font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .rule { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,191,0,.55), rgba(255,191,0,0)); margin: 24px 0; }
    code { color: #ffcf73; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="muted">Mobley Conglomerate</div>
    <h1>golfdad.cc</h1>
    <p>This domain is live on the machine and reserved in the canonical estate.</p>
    <p>It is being materialized as part of the local nginx rootsite tree so it can be served consistently from this origin.</p>
    <div class="rule"></div>
    <p class="muted">Canonical root will be attached here. Until then, this placeholder keeps the domain live.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>